    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a true deck builder.\u00a0<strong>Before each fight, you craft your deck</strong> from an ever growing library of unlocked cards.\u00a0<strong>Earn experience, unlock new cards, and customize your loadout freely.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/fec16a6708ba1054d343168fac1dfb21.poster.avif?t=1755307393\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/fec16a6708ba1054d343168fac1dfb21.webm?t=1755307393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/fec16a6708ba1054d343168fac1dfb21.mp4?t=1755307393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike most card games, <strong>you don\u2019t just receive energy each turn</strong>, you decide how much you want. <strong>Discard cards</strong> during your energy phase <strong>to generate the energy you need</strong>. Burn your hand for a burst of power or hold back for later turns. It\u2019s your call, every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/12d123845b6e823f736db028a4f81400.poster.avif?t=1755307393\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/12d123845b6e823f736db028a4f81400.webm?t=1755307393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/12d123845b6e823f736db028a4f81400.mp4?t=1755307393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an ever-expanding library of cards and <strong>full control over your deck before each battle.</strong>\u00a0Discover powerful synergies and unleash combo abilities. Each combat card serves a dual role, used for attacking or defending, depending on the current phase of combat. Many cards have discard effects, use these to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/1d7674b9460ad8f71911fdd5ccf83841.avif?t=1755307393\" width=800 height=371 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a quirky medieval world full of chibi knights and offbeat monsters, each battle is a compact, tactical challenge with big strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding, For Real</strong> \u2013 Freely build and change your deck from your unlocked library before every fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Driven Energy System</strong> \u2013 Discard cards to generate energy\u2014manage your hand <i>and</i> your momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock as You Go</strong> \u2013 Earn XP and expand your card library through battles and exploration. Not reliant on RNG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Adventure</strong> \u2013 A cute but deadly world of tiny knights and oversized enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f This page is a work in progress.  We truly appreciate your support as we refine our mechanics and gameplay\u2014your feedback is invaluable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game's art style is finalized and will remain consistent through to release. However, many assets you see are still placeholders or still require iterations for improvement. While this build focuses primarily on gameplay, we're also working hard to bring the visual elements closer to the final version.</i><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a true deck builder.\u00a0<strong>Before each fight, you craft your deck</strong> from an ever growing library of unlocked cards.\u00a0<strong>Earn experience, unlock new cards, and customize your loadout freely.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/fec16a6708ba1054d343168fac1dfb21.poster.avif?t=1755307393\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/fec16a6708ba1054d343168fac1dfb21.webm?t=1755307393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/fec16a6708ba1054d343168fac1dfb21.mp4?t=1755307393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike most card games, <strong>you don\u2019t just receive energy each turn</strong>, you decide how much you want. <strong>Discard cards</strong> during your energy phase <strong>to generate the energy you need</strong>. Burn your hand for a burst of power or hold back for later turns. It\u2019s your call, every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/12d123845b6e823f736db028a4f81400.poster.avif?t=1755307393\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/12d123845b6e823f736db028a4f81400.webm?t=1755307393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/12d123845b6e823f736db028a4f81400.mp4?t=1755307393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an ever-expanding library of cards and <strong>full control over your deck before each battle.</strong>\u00a0Discover powerful synergies and unleash combo abilities. Each combat card serves a dual role, used for attacking or defending, depending on the current phase of combat. Many cards have discard effects, use these to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782620/extras/1d7674b9460ad8f71911fdd5ccf83841.avif?t=1755307393\" width=800 height=371 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a quirky medieval world full of chibi knights and offbeat monsters, each battle is a compact, tactical challenge with big strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding, For Real</strong> \u2013 Freely build and change your deck from your unlocked library before every fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Driven Energy System</strong> \u2013 Discard cards to generate energy\u2014manage your hand <i>and</i> your momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock as You Go</strong> \u2013 Earn XP and expand your card library through battles and exploration. Not reliant on RNG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Adventure</strong> \u2013 A cute but deadly world of tiny knights and oversized enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f This page is a work in progress.  We truly appreciate your support as we refine our mechanics and gameplay\u2014your feedback is invaluable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game's art style is finalized and will remain consistent through to release. However, many assets you see are still placeholders or still require iterations for improvement. While this build focuses primarily on gameplay, we're also working hard to bring the visual elements closer to the final version.</i><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f</strong></p>",
